  "consumed": "RAM Nugs Primary",
  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 150eb (Premium) per dose<br><strong>Type:</strong> Street Drug</p>\n<p>Primary (4 hours): DEX and MOVE -2 (minimum 1). Net brain damage you take while Jacked In is reduced by 2. Once per Turn, take 2 Humanity Loss to attempt one more Quickhack (a different one, still costing a Net Action) on a target you already Quickhacked this Turn. Secondary (DV17): addiction. While addicted and not on RAM Nugs: TECH -2 (minimum 1).</p>\n<p><strong>Foundry notes:</strong></p><ul><li>While addicted, switch on the \"RAM Nugs Addiction\" effect.</li><li>When an addicted character doses, use \"RAM Nugs Addicted Primary\" instead of the normal primary effect; it cancels the withdrawal penalties for the duration.</li><li>Stat and skill changes are automated; caps, minimums, durations, and everything else are not.</li></ul>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Gear, Drugs, &amp; Frames &gt; Consumables &gt; Street Drugs).</em></p>"
